cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this replication package, please cite it as below."
title: "Replication package for: How Much Did the 1959 Stabilization Plan Matter? A Synthetic-Control Reassessment of Spain's Growth Acceleration"
abstract: "Full replication package for a synthetic-control estimate of the aggregate effect of Spain's 1959 Stabilization and Liberalization Plan on real GDP per capita, estimated on Penn World Table 11.0 data for 1950-1975. The package pins the raw input against versioned checksums, fixes every optimizer and screening setting in advance, and reproduces every table and figure of the paper with a single command."
type: software
